WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.584 --> 00:00:07.752
Yes, absolutely.

2
00:00:08.088 --> 00:00:12.744
Personal color isn't just about finding a 'pretty color' —

3
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:21.960
it's the deciding factor in whether you look ten years younger or ten years older.

4
00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:34.344
Even with flawless makeup and hair, wearing a hanbok color that doesn't suit you can deepen wrinkles and make your complexion look tired, due to clashing color contrast.

5
00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:46.368
During a one-on-one pre-consultation, a personal color analysis precisely examines your skin's natural depth, the sparkle in your eyes, and blue or yellow undertones to determine warm or cool tone,

6
00:00:46.704 --> 00:00:52.008
and find the ideal jeogori color for your seasonal type.

7
00:00:52.344 --> 00:01:02.256
This also lets us build a look that fits you perfectly, from base makeup to lip color and blush,

8
00:01:02.592 --> 00:01:11.928
which is the secret to looking younger on the wedding day and hearing genuine compliments like "You have such a lovely presence."
